Now, Marilyn's clothes!

265
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:19,560
There!

266
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:24,480
You've got guts!

267
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:28,640
Go! Go! Go! Go!

268
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:41,580
W-wow...

269
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:44,240
This is the picture I've been wanting!

270
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:47,280
With this,
a 40% ratings share isn't a dream!

271
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:58,360
That's not...
surely that's the Bookshelf Dog's

272
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,640
I called them here, you know.

273
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:03,580
Make this fight even more flashy!

274
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:08,860
What? No way...

275
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:13,660
I am the Bookshelf Dog
march's supreme commander.

276
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:23,760
!

277
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:27,280
So which one of you is the enemy, woman?

278
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:41,820
Hey there, sweetie, there's a great Kanto cuisine place nearby. Want to have dinner together tonight?
And after that, if you'd tell me about your phone bag or whatever, I'd be so happy~

279
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:45,320
Father, it's sort of like,
you know, that kind of thing.

280
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:49,840
They're coming this way too!

281
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:51,960
The music here is...

282
00:18:09,380 --> 00:18:10,100
Papa

283
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:13,420
I rushed over as soon as
I heard you were in trouble.

284
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:23,200
That's a sneaky way to make an entrance!

285
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:23,680
What?

286
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:25,220
Come on, play along with the bit!

287
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,000
Who is this guy?

288
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,980
He's the father of my enemy.

289
00:18:28,980 --> 00:18:30,360
Your enemy is...

290
00:18:30,820 --> 00:18:31,860
that woman.

291
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:39,000
What a scar!

292
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,980
Miss, you've noticed a good one.

293
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:45,740
This is the wound from
being shot in Vietnam.

294
00:18:45,740 --> 00:18:48,040
This one's from the Auckland conflict.

295
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:50,520
And this one's from the Gulf War.

296
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:51,880
And then there's this one,

297
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:55,060
the one my wife scratched me with.

298
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:57,100
This is my wife.

299
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:58,220
Pretty, isn't she?

300
00:19:00,900 --> 00:19:04,480
Starting to brag about your family out of nowhere,
you're not a man to be trusted.

301
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:06,060
Then I'll do the same.

302
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:08,900
My wife is a beauty, isn't she?

303
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:10,140
Liar!

304
00:19:11,980 --> 00:19:13,840
There's no way a beautiful
wife like that exists!

305
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:16,400
It's your photo that's the fake, you idiot!

306
00:19:16,740 --> 00:19:19,760
Insulting a soldier? I won't stand for it!

307
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:20,820
Frr-ip!

308
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:25,380
Aaaaaah! This is aaaaaah!

309
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:27,300
Pa-pa-pa-pineapple!

310
00:19:28,540 --> 00:19:31,777
Ruu-ruu-ruu... Ruby... i... iris...

311
00:19:31,827 --> 00:19:34,880
Tsuika... Kabateri... Ringo...

312
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:37,060
What are you doing, you old fool Honda!

313
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:39,740
Ka, ka, ka, bu, bu, burin...

314
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:40,740
Damn it!

315
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:45,820
You idiot!

316
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:49,080
Damn you, I won't forgive you!
I'll beat you to a pulp!

317
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:53,240
That's my line! Let's go, you guys!

318
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:04,680
Sorry!

319
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:07,180
Alright, go for it, go for it!

320
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:10,420
Go bigger! Honda, catch it properly!

321
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:11,540
Yes!

322
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:21,700
Okay!

323
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,240
I'm jumping in too!

324
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,260
Watch out!

325
00:20:39,260 --> 00:20:40,160
Phew.

326
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:42,780
Phew.

327
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:46,560
Are you okay?

328
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,620
That was close.

329
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:50,520
Are you okay?

330
00:20:50,860 --> 00:20:51,840
Yeah, thanks.

331
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:55,500
I didn't expect a con artist
like you to save someone.

332
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:59,220
Who would've thought I'd be
saved by a femme fatale like you.

333
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:00,860
Con artist?

334
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:01,880
Femme fatale.

335
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:03,580
Who said that?

336
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:06,820
Go for it! Go for it!

337
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:10,980
With this, we'll get a 50% rating!
Ten million!

338
00:21:11,280 --> 00:21:12,760
What's ten million?

339
00:21:16,420 --> 00:21:18,420
Everyone, how did you find this place?

340
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:21,840
With this much commotion,
how could they not notice?

341
00:21:24,240 --> 00:21:26,700
What's in this bag?

342
00:21:27,020 --> 00:21:28,440
Don't open it!

343
00:21:30,760 --> 00:21:32,780
Th-th-th-th-the

344
00:21:32,780 --> 00:21:33,440
Volume-san?

345
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:34,740
Lord Ryo?

346
00:21:37,220 --> 00:21:38,780
What on earth is going on?

347
00:21:39,100 --> 00:21:39,900
W-what?

348
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,340
Spill it!

349
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,160
That's it!

350
00:21:49,740 --> 00:21:50,620
Hello?

351
00:21:50,860 --> 00:21:52,240
We did it, Ryo-chan!

352
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:54,540
We've locked in the Sunday prime time slot!

353
00:21:54,740 --> 00:21:57,000
With this, a 30% rating is guaranteed!

354
00:21:57,360 --> 00:22:00,180
We're waiting for the finished Jodie vs.
Marilyn video!

355
00:22:02,160 --> 00:22:03,720
Ryo-chan, what's going on here?

356
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:07,260
W-wait, isn't this a wrong number?

357
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:11,400
We'd really like to
hear all about that, too.

358
00:22:11,560 --> 00:22:14,460
Huh? What happened to your fight, you two?

359
00:22:15,300 --> 00:22:18,620
Never mind that.
I want to know why Bobby is here.

360
00:22:19,360 --> 00:22:20,600
W-well, that's...

361
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:23,740
You've got some nerve, filling
people's heads with all sorts of lies.

362
00:22:24,060 --> 00:22:26,240
W-wait, we can talk this out!

363
00:22:27,120 --> 00:22:28,560
No excuses!

364
00:22:28,560 --> 00:22:38,220
Noooooooooooooooo!

365
00:22:38,220 --> 00:22:40,660
I don't know what this is about,
but this is our day of reckoning!

366
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:44,320
You two are going down too!

367
00:22:44,520 --> 00:22:45,800
Why are we the ones
getting dragged into this?!

368
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:48,406
Honestly,

369
00:22:48,456 --> 00:22:52,220
these guys are outrageous,
trying to sell other people's fights to TV.

370
00:22:53,060 --> 00:22:56,500
Come on, from now on,
let's all get along as a trio.

371
00:22:56,920 --> 00:22:58,560
Bobby's the one who started all this, right?

372
00:22:59,100 --> 00:23:01,040
You're the one to blame!

373
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:08,660
Hey, I like you.

374
00:23:08,660 --> 00:23:11,980
Me too,
I think you and I could be good friends.

375
00:23:13,080 --> 00:23:16,880
Since you came all the way to Hong Kong,
I'll introduce you to some good restaurants.

376
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,360
Fantastic!

377
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:20,880
Well then, shall we head back too?

378
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:21,560
Yeah, let's.

379
00:23:22,760 --> 00:23:25,120
Hey, wait a minute!

380
00:23:25,340 --> 00:23:26,920
You're leaving me behind?!

381
00:23:28,080 --> 00:23:30,800
Dad, go ahead and give him a good thrashing!

382
00:23:30,800 --> 00:23:32,620
Good luck, Father.

383
00:23:33,060 --> 00:23:34,380
Jolly!

384
00:23:34,380 --> 00:23:35,640
Leave it to me, Lin!

385
00:23:36,080 --> 00:23:38,240
Speaking of which,
what did we come to Hong Kong for again?

386
00:23:38,900 --> 00:23:39,920
Forget it!

387
00:23:40,280 --> 00:23:41,980
Ow!

388
00:23:42,060 --> 00:23:44,580
H-h-help me!

